{"job_id":"F-953399b9119a8eceb5fb","family_id":"F-953399b9119a8eceb5fb","title":"선박안전 조업규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007458-268125-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"f2547c38669452fb0aaa0f9416061d6a8b9e3053265285a209a2beaeb674f4a1","source_hash":"b03b65d31a2a3624c27b28f1acdd49ad48e2cd80b2a9714fc79cae8edcb928d9","text":"船舶安全操作规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007458-268125-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":61,"target_id":"a945a9ae088c1eccfa9526ee95e5ffb5984a85695aafdf788322347f3897cf44","source_hash":"c46824152f1eb206c4dc00c112c7dfa0eca44eb2a5902b89f1e64513aa830003","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定总吨位小于100吨的船舶离港和到港的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007458-268125-ko","scope":"BODY","start":61,"end":188,"target_id":"866b11f8af011a31e842c5ce11fb3de21094e6c06952f0f24d7ec9f2ae1230ef","source_hash":"98149157db44c3f8506a5a6003bbc84212cbe12736a5221a6ab3b6d8e3b9d8e5","text":"第二条（适用范围）本规则适用于总吨位小于100吨的船舶（以下简称“船舶”）。但是，《渔船法》第二条第一款规定的渔船、政府或公共实体拥有的船舶、客船以及在海外运营的船舶不适用本规则。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007458-268125-ko","scope":"BODY","start":188,"end":208,"target_id":"daee293d5b09ce47f2662c81f0092f631a41397e69d6f3734355a135c5f01507","source_hash":"96face5c311a7df0e8f19714b7bb8bd845b557da0e14883d376123f3bb7d7829","text":"删除第3条 <2020.8.28>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007458-268125-ko","scope":"BODY","start":208,"end":228,"target_id":"eca9fc5a558e0b244213f8ebe5a2293f3db503fe9f38424a459a1c7cf8bd0dbb","source_hash":"e378817a21bc39c3fd9eaac60ae47e46a9dd55acae97c30cb6e22a859ea08e3c","text":"删除条款 4 <2020.8.28>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-007458-268125-ko","scope":"BODY","start":228,"end":248,"target_id":"844a375defb803b2ee3ea4595e967e25bce27e884c48d93912868117397e1c71","source_hash":"abb2d4723f6eb7a9616ec7d52167cbb64d7c418e5d229a0fbac17ba0830e4c88","text":"删除条款 5 <2020.8.28>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","la